stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: Enqueued by Producer (immediate or scheduled)
    
    pending --> leased: Claimed by Worker via SELECT FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    note right of leased
        Lease deadline set (NOW() + 30s)
        Fencing token incremented
        Periodic heartbeats sent
    end note

    leased --> completed: Execution Succeeded
    note right of completed
        state = 'completed'
        Audit record written
        Lease released
    end note

    leased --> failed: Transient Execution Error
    note right of failed
        attempt < max_attempts
        Exponential backoff + Full Jitter calculated
        scheduled_at set to future timestamp
    end note

    failed --> pending: Delay Expired (scheduled_at <= NOW())

    leased --> dead_letter: Exhausted Retries (attempt >= max_attempts) OR Poison Pill
    note right of dead_letter
        Moved to dead_letter_jobs
        Stack trace & error logged
        Quarantined for operator review
    end note

    leased --> pending: Lease Expired (Worker Crash / Partition / Reaper)
    note right of pending
        lease_expires_at < NOW()
        Watchdog reaper detects expiration
        Fencing token incremented
        Zombie worker writes blocked
    end note

    dead_letter --> pending: Operator Manual Replay (jobctl dlq replay)

    completed --> [*]
